---
description: Authentication and authorization rules
globs: apps/api/src/auth/**/*.ts, apps/api/src/common/guards/**/*.ts
alwaysApply: false
---

# Auth baseline
- Use short-lived access tokens and rotating refresh tokens.
- Store refresh tokens securely; never persist them in plaintext.
- Password hashing should use a modern password hasher such as Argon2id.

# Authorization
- Keep auth guards explicit and composable.
- Enforce RBAC or ownership checks in guards/services, not in controllers alone.
- Never trust `userId` from the request body; read it from authenticated context.

# Abuse prevention
- Rate limit login, refresh, and password-reset style endpoints.
- Scope API keys narrowly and deny by default.
